WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:07.341
Everything is like always.

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:11.845
And then it's not.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.766
Things are not how I left them.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.103
They're not how they're supposed to be.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:23.440
Because after what he did...

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:26.652
everything changed.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.407
Nobody remembers anything different.

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:34.785
And then it happens again.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:36.578
And again.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.331
And again.

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:41.667
He's everybody.

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:44.962
He's nobody.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:50.425
He's all the time.

